Command: L
Effect : list lines
Modes  : x, x-y, x@y

Examples:
L 5      - list 5 lines starting at current line pointer
L 5-16   - list lines 5 through 16 inclusive
L 10@25  - list 10 lines starting at line 25

Note: The L command does _not_ advance the line pointer; that is, listing
      lines has no effect on what line you are currently 'looking' at.
